     5	/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     6	 * Allocation seam.
     7	 *
     8	 * Every allocation in this file goes through these two wrappers, never
     9	 * through malloc/free directly. HW2 replaces the bodies with a
    10	 * fault-injecting allocator; keeping the seam here means that change never
    11	 * has to touch the tree code itself.
